Godot's resource importer must leave this directory alone. These PNGs are
documentation — the Machine contact sheets that make the readability claim in
ASSET_PIPELINE.md section 6 re-checkable — not game assets. Without this file the
importer claims all three, writes a .import sidecar beside each, costs an import
pass several megabytes of texture conversion, and carries them into an export of
a game that never draws them.

Rebuild them with `bash tools/assets/render_machines.sh`.
